   "key": "func APIKeyEditorView.removeKeyAndConsent()",
   "hash": "87eac1cb084633fd",
   "does": "Deletes the provider's keychain key and revokes its consent either way. When the delete failed it logs a warning, leaves web search alone, re-reads hasExistingKey (still true) and shows no 'Key removed.' status, so the page keeps showing the saved key. When it succeeded, turns enableWebSearch off if no web-search route is left (APIKeyStore.hasWebSearchRoute false: no Tavily key and no Anthropic key, whichever provider was removed), then hasExistingKey=false, saveStatus=.removed. Calls onChange.",
   "entry": "'Remove key' button tap",
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/Views/AIAssistantSettingsPage.swift::var APIKeyEditorView.keys",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/Keys/APIKeyStore.swift::func APIKeyStore.removeKey(for:)",
